diff --git a/miner/README.md b/miner/README.md
index 51c2f8f5..b98c0de3 100644
--- a/miner/README.md
+++ b/miner/README.md
@@ -5,8 +5,9 @@ The CLI and optional desktop GUI share the same mining library. They use Lotus's
 160-byte block headers and `getrawunsolvedblock`/`submitblock` RPCs.
 
 The CLI accepts `--protocol=v1|v2`, with V1 as the default. V2 selection exits
-with an unsupported error before mining because its daemon job API and kernel
-scheduler are pending. The candidate V2 CPU/OpenCL header hashes and integration gates
+with an unsupported error before mining because its daemon job API and GPU
+scheduler are pending. The GUI shows the same error without starting mining.
+The candidate V2 CPU/OpenCL header hashes and integration gates
